{"id":"4510f856c7696c01","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties.md","title":"Ordinal Multiplication Properties","display":"thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties — Ordinal Multiplication Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties","aliases":["58-thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties"],"display":"thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties — Ordinal Multiplication Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties — Ordinal Multiplication Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d74493bfaf9bf48a\" href=\"?note=d74493bfaf9bf48a\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic\">../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\)</span> (ordinals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication\\text{-}properties}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha\\cdot\\gamma\n\\land\n(\\alpha\\cdot\\beta)\\cdot\\gamma=\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta\\cdot\\gamma)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication\\text{-}properties}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha\\cdot\\gamma\n\\land\n(\\alpha\\cdot\\beta)\\cdot\\gamma=\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta\\cdot\\gamma)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The theorem records left distributivity of ordinal multiplication over addition, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\beta+\\alpha\\gamma\">\\(\\alpha(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\beta+\\alpha\\gamma\\)</span>, and associativity; right distributivity, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\alpha+\\beta)\\gamma=\\alpha\\gamma+\\beta\\gamma\">\\((\\alpha+\\beta)\\gamma=\\alpha\\gamma+\\beta\\gamma\\)</span>, generally fails.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d74493bfaf9bf48a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}multiplication\\text{-}properties}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\to\\Bigl(\n\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\cdot\\beta+\\alpha\\cdot\\gamma\n\\land\n(\\alpha\\cdot\\beta)\\cdot\\gamma=\\alpha\\cdot(\\beta\\cdot\\gamma)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha(\\beta+\\gamma)=\\alpha\\beta+\\alpha\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"(\\alpha+\\beta)\\gamma=\\alpha\\gamma+\\beta\\gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1094,"backlinks":[{"id":"8243b3b9c258446d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4339","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties.md|58-thm-ordinal-multiplication-properties]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["d74493bfaf9bf48a","5582a281f15a33c2"]}